---
/* L41 - the mock is a hash, so repeats agree. One writer: the figures workstream C. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L41.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of a seed, question id and state entering a hash box and leaving along two identical routes to two matching output dots joined by a dashed line."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L41-fig-title L41-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L41-fig-title">One input, one hash, the same number twice</title>
      <desc id="L41-fig-desc">
        An input box on the left lists a seed, a question id and a state. Arrows lead into a tinted sha256 box in the middle, and from there two identical routes branch to two circles on the right, one for run 1 and one for run 2. Both circles carry the same value, and a dashed vertical line joins them, showing that the two runs produced the same number. The routes draw themselves, then the two circles pulse together.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="L41-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--color-ink-45)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <rect x="40" y="72" width="150" height="116" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="56" y="98" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">input</text>
      <text x="56" y="126" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">seed</text>
      <text x="56" y="148" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">qid</text>
      <text x="56" y="170" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">state</text>

      <rect x="250" y="102" width="110" height="56" fill="var(--color-prussian-tint)" stroke="var(--color-prussian)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="268" y="136" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-prussian)">sha256</text>

      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 70; --m-duration: 0.8s;" d="M 190 130 L 246 130" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L41-arrow)" />
      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 120; --m-duration: 1s; --m-delay: 0.35s;" d="M 360 130 L 400 130 L 400 82 L 436 82" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L41-arrow)" />
      <path class="m-draw" style="--m-length: 120; --m-duration: 1s; --m-delay: 0.35s;" d="M 360 130 L 400 130 L 400 182 L 436 182" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-ink)" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#L41-arrow)" />

      <circle class="m-pulse" style="--m-duration: 1.2s; --m-delay: 1.1s;" cx="444" cy="82" r="6" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
      <circle class="m-pulse" style="--m-duration: 1.2s; --m-delay: 1.1s;" cx="444" cy="182" r="6" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
      <text x="462" y="86" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">u</text>
      <text x="462" y="186" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">u</text>
      <text x="462" y="62" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">run 1</text>
      <text x="462" y="166" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">run 2</text>

      <line x1="424" y1="82" x2="424" y2="182" stroke="var(--color-prussian)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
      <text x="326" y="222" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-prussian)">same seed, same state, same number</text>
      <text x="40" y="262" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">change the seed and you get a different mock,</text>
      <text x="40" y="278" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">reproducibly - two mocks to compare, no spend</text>

    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L41</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">Every mock number is a hash of the seed, the question and the state, so the same input always gives the same answer and a different seed gives a different, reproducible mock.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  /* scoped to this figure */
  .fig__svg {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
